Takeaway

While regulation-related news is often assumed to significantly influence cryptocurrency markets, this project suggests that Bitcoin price behavior is far more complex. News sentiment and volume alone are insufficient predictors, emphasizing the challenges of applying traditional statistical and machine learning techniques to highly volatile financial assets.

Future Improvements

Incorporate sentiment analysis instead of article volume alone

Expand analysis to intraday price data

Include additional macroeconomic and market indicators

Experiment with deep learning time-series models (LSTM, Transformers)
